  "text": "Zealots ferret out plots against their religion and seek justice for their church's followers. This zealot serves Asmodeus, but others might serve Abadar, Calistria, Iomedae, Norgorber, Pharasma, Sarenrae, or Zon-Kuthon. They often ride a War Horse wearing light barding. To depict a zealot's mount, add this horse to the encounter as an additional monster with its own actions, adjusting the encounter's XP budget accordingly.\n\n---\nReligions inspire devout individuals to uphold their tenets."
